OL,3,GNEWSAHow the hair of a museum bear is
OL,4,Ahelping tackle wildlife crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis PhD research involves analysing
OL,7,FBoris's fur to compare how its
OL,8,Fcharacteristics could improve
OL,9,Fidentification of animal hairs during
OL,10,Finvestigations.
